# Manual API checks. Run `npm run dev` first.
# Open in Cursor/VS Code with the REST Client extension and click "Send Request",
# or use the curl equivalents at the bottom.
# /api/health and /api/todos are example routes that don't exist yet; adjust to the routes you build.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### List todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos

### Create a todo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Practise the interview flow" }

### Create a todo with a missing title (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create a todo with invalid JSON (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

not json

# curl equivalents:
# curl -i http://localhost:3000/api/health
# curl -i http://localhost:3000/api/todos
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"title":"Practise"}'
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{}'
